{"parse": {"title": "Chest (Obor's lair)", "pageid": 588786, "revid": 15339759, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Scenery\n|version1 = Closed\n|version2 = Open\n|name = Chest\n|image1 = [[File:Chest (Obor's lair, closed).png|250px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Chest (Obor's lair, open).png|250px]]\n|release = [[25 June]] [[2025]]\n|update = Summer Sweep Up: Combat\n|members = No\n|quest = No\n|location = Obor's Lair in [[Edgeville Dungeon]]\n|options1 = Open\n|options2 = None\n|examine = Probably where Obor keeps all of his valuables.\n|map = {{Map|mtype=pin|mapID=-1|zoom=2|3085,9797}}\n|id1 = 56380\n|id2 = 56381\n|leagueRegion = Misthalin\n}}\nThe '''chest''' is found in [[Obor]]'s lair in [[Edgeville Dungeon]], and can be opened with a [[giant key]] after defeating [[Obor]], once per kill. It is the only source of the [[hill giant club]], a unique and powerful two-handed melee weapon.\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=7218}}\n\n{{Average drop value|mobname=Obor's Chest|killname=loot}}\n\nExcluding [[Hill giant club]] drops, the average loot is worth {{Coins|floor(({{Average drop value|mob=Chest (Obor's lair)|raw=y}} - (1/118) * {{GEP|Hill giant club}}))}}.\n\n===100%===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Clue scroll (beginner)|quantity=1|rarity=Always|raritynotes={{Refn|name=clue|group=d|After the completion of [[X Marks the Spot]], a [[scroll box (beginner)]] will be dropped instead.}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Ensouled giant head|namenotes={{(m)}}|quantity=1|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Uniques===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Hill giant club|quantity=1|rarity=1/118|raritynotes={{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/836949215158890496|date=1 March 2017|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/109143|archivedate=28 May 2020|quote=1 / 118.}}}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Weapons and armour===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Rune kiteshield|quantity=1|rarity=3/118|raritynotes={{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1002111464482705408|date=31 May 2018|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/97879|archivedate=28 May 2020|quote=3/118}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Rune full helm|quantity=1|rarity=5/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Rune med helm|quantity=1|rarity=6/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Rune chainbody|quantity=1|rarity=3/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Rune platelegs|quantity=1|rarity=3/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Rune plateskirt|quantity=1|rarity=3/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Rune battleaxe|quantity=1|rarity=4/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Rune longsword|quantity=1|rarity=5/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Rune 2h sword|quantity=1|rarity=3/118}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Runes===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Law rune|quantity=50-99|rarity=12/118|raritynotes={{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/826835915020570624|date=1 February 2017|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/97898|archivedate=28 May 2020|quote=7, 10, 10 and 12 / 118 respectively [for nature, chaos, death, and law runes].|name=oborrateash}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Cosmic rune|quantity=60-119|rarity=12/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Chaos rune|quantity=100-199|rarity=10/118|raritynotes={{NamedRef|oborrateash}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Death rune|quantity=40-79|rarity=10/118|raritynotes={{NamedRef|oborrateash}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Nature rune|quantity=40-79|rarity=7/118|raritynotes={{NamedRef|oborrateash}}}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Coins|quantity=10000-15000|rarity=6/118|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Coins|quantity=12000-20000|rarity=4/118|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Limpwurt root|quantity=20 (noted)|rarity=8/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Big bones|quantity=50 (noted)|rarity=8/118}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Uncut ruby|quantity=5 (noted)|rarity=5/118|raritynotes=<ref name=\"gems\" group=d>Uncut rubies and diamonds always drop together.</ref>}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Uncut diamond|quantity=5 (noted)|rarity=5/118|raritynotes=<ref name=\"gems\" group=d></ref>}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=d}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Giant key|quantity=1|rarity=1/16|raritynotes={{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/857953447525699584|date=31 May 2018|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/99896|archivedate=28 May 2020|quote=It's got a 1/16 chance for Obor to drop another one.}}|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=\"d\"}}\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Chests}}\n{{Edgeville Dungeon}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:36.795971+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Clue_scroll_(beginner)\" title=\"Clue scroll (beginner)\"><img alt=\"Clue scroll (beginner).png: Chest (Obor&#39;s lair) drops Clue scroll (beginner) with rarity Always in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Clue_scroll_%28beginner%29.png?09bb0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"31\" data-file-height=\"27\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Clue_scroll_(beginner)\" title=\"Clue scroll (beginner)\">Clue scroll (beginner)</a></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\">1</td><td data-sort-value=\"1\" class=\"table-bg-blue\"><span>Always</s